<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><B><U>Explanatory Note</U></B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.5in">On August&nbsp;13, 2024, Kaixin Holdings (the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;)
furnished to the Securities and Exchange Commission a Report on Form&nbsp;6-K (the &ldquo;Original 6-K&rdquo;) that included the notice,
the proxy statement and form of proxy card related to the Company&rsquo;s Extraordinary General Meeting, which will be held on October&nbsp;1,
2024 at 10:00 a.m.&nbsp;(Beijing time). The Company is filing this amendment (the &ldquo;Amendment&rdquo;) to the Original 6-K to revise
the Exhibit&nbsp;99.2 of the Original 6-K to provide an amended Notice of Extraordinary General Meeting and an amended Proxy Statement
together with an amended proxy card. This Amendment reflects the (1)&nbsp;amendment to the number of shares redesignation and reclassification
on the Share Capital Adjustment proposal and (2)&nbsp;the increase in the ratio of the reverse stock split from 16:1 to 50:1 on the Share
Consolidation proposal.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

<!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 2 -->
